%% Title: Human Interrupt and Quiz Flow
%% Description: What happens when a student speaks or is quizzed during debate

sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Student
    participant LK as LiveKit Room
    participant VAD as Silero VAD
    participant STT as Deepgram STT
    participant Eng as DebateEngine
    participant Groq as Groq LLM
    participant FE as Frontend

    Note over Eng: human_silent_turns >= 5

    Eng->>Groq: Generate quiz question
    Groq-->>Eng: "What's your take on...?"
    Eng->>LK: Publish quiz_event
    LK-->>FE: quiz_event displayed
    Eng->>Eng: Start 30s timer

    alt Student Speaks
        U->>LK: Mic audio
        LK->>VAD: Audio frames
        VAD->>STT: Speech detected
        STT-->>Eng: "I think we should..."
        Eng->>Eng: add_human_turn(text)
        Eng->>Eng: human_silent_turns = 0
        Eng->>Eng: Resume debate loop
    else 30s Timeout
        Eng->>Groq: Agent self-answers
        Groq-->>Eng: "Let me answer that..."
        Eng->>LK: Publish turn_committed
        Eng->>Eng: Resume debate loop
    end
